<title>POLAND: NBP OFFERS TO SELL PLN 900 MLN OF NBP-BILLS.</title>
<headline>NBP OFFERS TO SELL PLN 900 MLN OF NBP-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland</p>
<p>offered to sell 600 million zlotys of 182-day NBP-bills and 300</p>
<p>million zlotys of 273-day NBP-bills, the bank said.</p>
<p>    Deadline hour		 - 12:00</p>
<p>    Date of settlement	  - January 7, 1997</p>
<p>    Maturity of bills offered - July 8, 1997, October 7, 1997</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
